    "reviews_grid_8H66nA": {
      "type": "reviews-grid",
      "blocks": {
        "review_Qecwhm": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "quote": "<p>“I’m 44 and have tried just about every powder on the market, but they always made me feel so bloated. I’ve been taking these liquid sachets for six weeks now and the difference is night and day. My skin actually feels ‘plump’ again, especially around my eyes where I usually get dry. Plus, no bloating at all!”</p>",
            "name": "Sarah J. (Melbourne, VIC)"
          }
        },
        "review_EDmF7D": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "quote": "<p>“I bought this specifically for my hair after a lot of postpartum shedding. It took about two months of consistent daily use, but I’m finally seeing all these little baby hairs coming in at my temples. The Wild Berry flavor is nice—I just mix it into my morning water and go. It’s a bit of an investment, but the results are actually visible.”</p>",
            "name": "Elena D. (Brisbane, QLD)"
          }
        },
        "review_tM4fXk": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "quote": "<p>“Honestly, I was mostly interested in the Vitamin D and Hyaluronic Acid combo since I’m always running low on energy. Not only do I feel a bit more ‘vibrant’ throughout the day, but my nail technician actually asked what I was doing differently because my natural nails are so much stronger. Definitely sticking with the subscription.”</p>",
            "name": "Rachel W. (Perth, WA)"
          }
        },
        "review_t6GmRM": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "stars": 5,
            "quote": "<p>“I’ve been using the Mango & Mandarin for about 3 months. At first, I wasn’t sure if it was doing much, but then I looked at a photo of myself from last year and my skin looks so much more radiant now. The fine lines on my forehead have softened significantly. It has a slight 'vitamin' taste, but it’s 100% worth it for the glow it gives.”</p>",
            "name": "Michelle K. (Sydney, NSW)"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "review_Qecwhm",
        "review_EDmF7D",
        "review_tM4fXk",
        "review_t6GmRM"
      ],
      "name": "Reviews Grid",
      "settings": {
